+"""Verified problem generator for arXiv:2206.11052.
+
+The generated task uses the matching characterization in Theorem 3.1 of
+Steffen--Wolf.  A balanced odd-regular signed bipartite graph is presented in
+projective coordinates.  The solver must give a normalized PGL(2,p) matrix
+whose graph is a perfect matching of the displayed graph.  That matching is an
+exact, directly checked certificate that deleting it leaves even maximum
+degree, hence it is the certificate occurring in Theorem 3.1.
+"""
