+union of equally distributed projective-linear perfect matchings, with an
+independently switched balanced signature.  The answer is sampled first and
+carried into the graph; it is never recovered by solving.  Non-affine plants
+defeat translation and small-coefficient ansatzes, pairwise-disjoint images
